WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.200 --> 00:00:02.834
-Welcome back to "The Tonight Show."

00:00:02.834 --> 00:00:04.901
We're about to play a game called "Box of Lies."

00:00:04.901 --> 00:00:08.033
