00:00:33.400 --> 00:00:35.968
On your turn, you pick a box, take out the object,

00:00:35.968 --> 00:00:37.601
and describe it to your opponent.

00:00:37.601 --> 00:00:39.400
-Can I sit down? -Yes, please.

00:00:39.400 --> 00:00:41.801
