00:00:49.567 --> 00:00:51.868
I can't even look at you. Or if we're lying.

00:00:51.868 --> 00:00:52.901
Okay? -Alright.

00:00:52.901 --> 00:00:54.801
-Are you already playing right now?

00:00:54.801 --> 00:00:56.234
